---
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeader num="02" title="Manifesto" sub="Design Principles" />
    <p class="text-base mb-7 max-w-[640px] text-fg-secondary">
      One primary navy, one accent blue, neutral grays. This system is built for clarity: stable, restrained, and deliberate.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-none m-0 p-0">
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>Page background is pure white #FFFFFF, never tinted</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>Primary brand is deep navy #001C44 — one dominant hue</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>Accent is blue #007FFF only; no second chromatic hue</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>All grays are neutral, no warm or cool undertone bias</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>Sans-serif for UI; reserved serif for editorial display</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>Font-weight 400 body, 500-600 headings. Avoid synthetic bold</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>Three line-height bands: tight 1.15 / comfortable 1.4 / reading 1.6</li>
      <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-fg-secondary"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-brand-accent"></span>No hard drop shadows — use ring shadows or whisper elevation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
